Chapter: CreatureCarveData

 Modified UOX3 creature CARVE meat (kind 0) and hides (kind 1) data, GPL-2.0-or-later.
 Copyright 1997, 98 Marcus Rating (Cironian); see the retained UOX3 license.
 Source and limitations: WorldSpawns.md. License: ports/UOX3-LICENSE.txt.
  cvd-limit : Integer = 291
 UOX3 carves by the NPC's section, which shearing (0xCF to 0xDF, sheepshearing.js) does not change.
  cvd-carve : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cvd-carve (table) (body) (kind) = if body == #00DF then cvd-carve table #00CF kind
    else if body < 0 | body >= cvd-limit then 0 else peek-16 table (body * 4 + kind * 2)
  cvd-clear : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cvd-clear (table) (i) = if i == cvd-limit then 0 else let z = poke-32 table (i * 4) 0 in cvd-clear table (i + 1)
  cvd-fill-0 : Integer -> Integer
  cvd-fill-0 (table) =
    let r0 = poke-32 table 4 2
    in let r1 = poke-32 table 8 4
    in let r2 = poke-32 table 20 1
